sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (Next.js)
  participant A as FastAPI backend
  participant M as MongoDB (Motor)
  participant T as TabTransformer model
  participant L as OpenRouter LLM (Qwen 2.5 72B)

  rect rgb(255, 247, 214)
  Note over B,L: AUTH
  B->>A: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
  A->>M: find user by email
  M-->>A: user record (hashed password)
  A->>A: bcrypt verify -> JWT {sub, role}
  A-->>B: 200 {access_token, user}
  B->>B: store token + user in localStorage
  end

  rect rgb(229, 245, 229)
  Note over B,L: NEW ASSESSMENT (dashboard submit)
  B->>A: POST /api/patients (patient data)
  A->>M: insert patient
  M-->>A: patient saved

  B->>A: POST /api/predictions (30 fields) + Bearer JWT
  Note over A: require_role("doctor") -> 403 if not
  A->>M: find patient by patient_id
  M-->>A: patient (404 if missing)
  A->>A: _prepare_input: 7 numerical scaled + 22 categorical indexed
  A->>T: forward(numerical, categorical) [no_grad]
  T-->>A: logits -> softmax(T=5) -> probs, class, confidence
  A->>A: risk_score = weighted sum of probs
  A->>M: insert predictions doc
  A->>L: asyncio.to_thread -> summary + recommendations prompts
  L-->>A: bullet text (or fallback if unreachable)
  A->>M: insert llm_reports doc
  A-->>B: {prediction, clinical_summary, recommendations, report_sources}
  B-->>B: render RiskPredictionCard gauge + AI assessment
  end

  rect rgb(221, 238, 255)
  Note over B,L: READING HISTORY / REPORTS
  B->>A: GET /api/predictions (list)
  A->>M: find predictions sorted by created_at desc
  M-->>A: history documents
  A-->>B: PredictionHistory[] (renders MiniHistory, StatsCard, table)

  B->>A: GET /api/predictions/{id}/report
  A->>M: find llm_reports by prediction_id
  M-->>A: report document
  A-->>B: {summary, recommendations, sources}
  B-->>B: render AiClinicalAssessment / Reports page
  end